      "writtenOn": "2025-10-06T18:59:33Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Looked at the other CLs in the stack and now I\u0027m wondering if it would make more sense to have a `makeGetSize` or something instead of removing the other two? My understanding for the change is that right now `size_t` types are getting confused with other types, so if we have an explicit helper maybe that would be better than specifying the different ones at the callsites?",
